                ["Perhaps I was too hasty, <v0>. But I would see my father avenged."];
                ["If thou art truly searching for my father's killer, then I will tell thee what I have learned."];
                TurnOn("learned");
            }
            key ("learned") {
                TurnOff("learned");
                ["Mother mentioned that a guest -- a mage by the name of Batlin -- also disappeared the same night father did. I know for a fact that Angus hated mages and would never have gone anywhere with one willingly... or alive!"];
                ["The name Batlin stirred something in my brain, so I asked around Monitor before I left. And I discovered some very interesting things indeed."];
                TurnOn("interesting");
            }
            key ("interesting") {
                TurnOff("interesting");
                ["Batlin came to Monitor some time ago. He was accompanied by several unsavory companions -- one was a huge hooded man, like the one that mother mentioned in her letter."];
                ["This odd party came asking about the Serpent ruins. The mage was unusually interested in anything to do with the Serpent people."];
                ["And... After Batlin and his henchmen left Monitor, it was discovered that a valuable Serpent relic was stolen from Andral, the sculptor."];
