                ["One was a dark-skinned fighter, very strong but seemingly lacking in wit."];
                ["And the other, as I have said, was a tall hooded man -- No one recalls hearing him speak at all. So perhaps he is mute."];
            }
            key ("relic") {
                TurnOff("relic");
                ["Though Andral is a Pikeman, I still cannot understand the interest he places in pieces of stone..."];
                ["He was the one that told me a carved blackrock serpent was missing soon after the mage left. Apparently it was a family heirloom or something."];
            }
            key ("Argus") {
                TurnOff("Argus");
                ["Thou shouldst say cowardly cur, instead!"];
                ["He was so glad of an excuse to flee his accusers in Monitor that he ran all the way to the inn when mother notified us of father's disappearance!"];
